{\fscx0\fscy0\t(0,2000,\fscx120\fscy120)}{\fs28}{\t(15,\fs2)}{\fad(38,2000)}{\2c&HE73C01&}{\fnCalibri\c&HFF6633&\kf400}{\c&H5555FF&\t(5000,10000,\c&HFF0000)}
اتمنى لكم مشاهدة ممتعة
